.. image:: ws2812b-20x10-display_test.gif
   :align: right
   :alt: SeenGreat Pico RGB Matrix Panel Expansion S1 Display Test Pattern

Using the :external+zephyr:ref:`Display driver API <display_api>`
with chosen display. That is:

| :hwftlbl-scr:`LED(20×10)` :
  :dts:`chosen { zephyr,display = &led_strip_matrix; };`
| :hwftlbl-led:`20×10 RGB` :
  :dts:`&led_strip_matrix { led-strip = <&led_strip>; };`

.. tabs::

   .. zephyr-keep-sorted-start re(^\s{3}\.\. group-tab:: \w)

   .. group-tab:: Raspberry Pi Pico

      .. zephyr-app-commands::
         :app: zephyr/samples/drivers/display
         :build-dir: seengreat_pico_rgb_matrix_pes1-display_test
         :board: rpi_pico/rp2040/bbe
         :shield: "seengreat_pico_rgb_matrix_pes1"
         :snippets: "usb-console"
         :west-args: -p
         :flash-args: -r uf2
         :goals: flash
         :compact:

